  "source_gate": "SD",
  "reason": "CD+Tests exposed a second design gap: the revised forward-only rule checks only the stored gate. The existing smoke scenario (packages/cli/scripts/smoke-test.js, gate-check presentation scenarios, line ~2072) stores gate UR with the hand-authored next step \"Draft PRD.\" for an evaluated PRD gate and requires that text to stay visible; the forward-only rule replaces it with the generic PRD text. PRD AC-003 requires that both the stored gate and the stored next step belong to an earlier gate.",
  "intended_change": "Revise SDD-01 and SDD-04: a stored next step is stale only when the run is active, the evaluated gate moved forward past the stored gate, and the stored text is a registered canonical operational value of the English locale pack in plugins/agdf/meta/agdf-interaction-locales.json (loaded through resources/context.js) that differs from the evaluated text. Hand-authored texts are never replaced. The observed cockpit defect (canonical Brownfield Analysis text, forward move) stays fixed; both existing safety and smoke scenarios stay unchanged.",
